{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10272020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10272020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1027202001:1":{"text":"What happened?","source_cn":"发生了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDDAFBFDC1527FB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027202002:0":{"text":"Do you remember Yolanda, from Lunadorf? She hasn't returned since entering the portal!","source_cn":"莱卡队长，月湖村的约兰达进入传送阵后一直没有返回！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C9FA12551EA4A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027202003:0":{"text":"She said she just wanted to see where the portal led and what the scenery was like. She should have been back by now.","source_cn":"按照她的说法，她只是想看看传送石阵通往哪里，那边的景色...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CCE75A43742998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1027202003":{"text":"She said she just wanted to see where the portal led and what the scenery was like. She should have been back by now.","source_cn":"按照她的说法，她只是想看看传送石阵通往哪里，那边的景色如何，不应该这么久都不回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CCE75A43742998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027202004:0":{"text":"Correct. These teleportation mechanisms from ancient times are fairly uncommon now.","source_cn":"嗯，这是古时候遗留下来的传送机关，并不多见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD63864CE34CF452D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027202005:0":{"text":"Now I remember... through this portal, there's an island in the heart of a lake with no other way to return.","source_cn":"我记得……这个传送石阵对面是一座湖心小岛，没有其他可以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB9A771BC094933A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027202007:0":{"text":"How long has she been gone?","source_cn":"约兰达进去多久了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EACD4E178688A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027202008:0":{"text":"A little more than half a day.","source_cn":"大约小半天的时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB80B03490B1AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027202009:0":{"text":"I was going to investigate, but I'm still on guard duty and can't abandon my post. No one else has the time, either.","source_cn":"我本来想去看看的，可我还在站岗，不能擅离职守，其他队员...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEC2B4B56126D761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1027202010:0":{"text":"No, you've done the right thing. If a gruglin snuck up and destroyed the portal, Yolanda would never make it back. I'll find her.","source_cn":"你做的没错，万一被咕布林偷袭，破坏了传送石阵，过去的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9006AC1F2347A4C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027202011:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, would you like to join me? It shouldn't take long.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF05B396CFDFE81","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, would you like to join me? It shouldn't take long.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, would you like to join me? It shouldn't take long.","variant_male_record_index":"107860","variant_female_record_index":"107861","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1027202011":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, would you like to join me? It shouldn't take long.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style><male>先生</male><female>小姐</female>，你要和我一起过去看看吗？不会耽误太多时间的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF05B396CFDFE81","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, would you like to join me? It shouldn't take long.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, would you like to join me? It shouldn't take long.","variant_male_record_index":"107860","variant_female_record_index":"107861","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1027202012:1":{"text":"Then, let's not waste time!","source_cn":"嗯，那我们这就出发吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8625890BE2AD0FCC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Then, let's not waste time!","female":"Then, let's not waste time!","variant_male_record_index":"107862","variant_female_record_index":"107863","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1027202013:1":{"text":"Avia, guard this place well.","source_cn":"艾维娅，守好这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x548FFB7968E5469C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1027202014:1":{"text":"Of course, Captain Lyca!","source_cn":"当然！莱卡队长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62CE09A8C8BD6309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"Let's act before it's too late!","source_cn":"救人要紧，事不宜迟！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0D6DA0363E254CAA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's act before it's too late!","female":"Let's act before it's too late!","variant_male_record_index":"60758","variant_female_record_index":"60759","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"Let's go see what we can find.","source_cn":"去看看吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A3DB336E4DF3A3E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's go see what we can find.","female":"Let's go see what we can find.","variant_male_record_index":"60760","variant_female_record_index":"60761","d